MODULE: BindingConvergesOrdinaryNotRead
TARGET: BindingConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the fair ordinary drain remains stalled after the binding changes to the current source
PERTURBS: ReadOrdinary

--- FIND
ReadOrdinary ==
    /\ Idle /\ bound = alias /\ read < Len(logs[bound])
--- REPLACE
ReadOrdinary ==
    /\ FALSE
    /\ Idle /\ bound = alias /\ read < Len(logs[bound])
--- END
